      <title>尽管伊朗战争造成干扰，石油巨头沙特阿美公司的利润仍大幅增长 33%</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/saudi-aramco-oil-bp-earnings-iran-war.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[油价上涨推动沙特阿拉伯能源巨头季度盈利大幅增长，该公司利用管道来解决霍尔木兹海峡的中断问题。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/saudi-aramco-oil-bp-earnings-iran-war.html</guid>
